                "description": "The Modern Sandcast Bronze Knobset with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Sandcast Bronze Round Knob with #6 is perfect for transitional decor. The contemporary shape paired with the rustic sandcast material makes for something truly unique and stunning. Choose from flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Square Sandcast Bronze Knob with Square Rose is suitable for interior doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick and it has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "Modern Sandcast Bronze Knobset with Square Roses, EMT-7061BZRN, Sandcast Bronze Round Knob with #6, Sandcast Bronze Round Knob with Round #6 Rosettes, Emtek 7061BZRN, Emtek 7061BZRN, Emtek 7211BZRG, Square Sandcast Bronze Knob with Square Roses, transitional hardware,"
